  "[silence] the second son says nothing.",
  "the eldest son (to the second son): \"We have been working for two years and still we have not enough. What do we do with the rest of our money? We have to give it away, and we have to give it away to our friends, and we have to give it away in our time of need.\"",
  "[action] Wang Lung hears the discussion and feels uneasy.",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"Well, and what will happen in the end, old father? I know we shall be poor men and we shall go away and live in a poor house and there we shall die.\"",
  "[action] Wang Lung is puzzled by his son's words.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Well, and I do not know what you mean.\"",
  "[action] (to the eldest son, the second son) Wang Lung asks his sons about their plans.",
  "[action] (to the second son) Eldest son gives his brother money.",
  "[action] (to the eldest son, the second son) Wang Lung looks at his two sons with suspicion.",
  "[action] (to Wang Lung) Eldest son gives his brother money.",
  "[action] (to the eldest son, the second son) Wang Lung observes his sons' secretive behavior.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son, the second son): \"Well, and what is this?\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son, the second son): \"Well, and I will give it to the fool who has no use for it, for I am too old for such things.\"",
